[00:01.00]Dear Wang Lei,
[00:02.27]Thank you very much for those five wonderful days at your house！
[00:07.90]Every moment was a delight.
[00:10.34]I can’t remember ever having enjoyed myself so thoroughly elsewhere.
[00:16.60]This is to tell you again how much I enjoyed the weekend in Hangzhou.
